      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "大剣闘祭参加者よ、貴様達の戦いは不甲斐ない！\n我々と勝負せよ、そして、敗れたならば\n参加資格をおいて、ダグシオンを去るがいい！\nソナイ峠に来い！　待っているぞ！",
        "official_en": "You are sloppy amateurs! Prove your worth! Fight us!\nIf you lose, we take your spot in the Heroic Games!\nWe await you at Sonai Pass. Come face us if you are\nnot a coward!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
