      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "わ、我々を倒すとは……参加者の中にも、\n少しは骨のある奴がいるようだな。\n参加資格を奪ってやろうと思ったがやめだ！\nこのままでは済まさん……今に見ていろ！",
        "official_en": "You defeated us? You have some skill after all. I had\nplanned to let you off easy if you surrendered your\nspot in the Heroic Games. But do not think this\nis the last you'll see of us!",
        "real_en": null
      },
